{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a high school girl stranded on a deserted island. Craft tools, find food, and strive to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can play up to Day 20 in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Day 21 begins, the demo is considered complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience realistic survival with parameters like hydration, sleep, and illness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The island's layout changes each time you play, offering fresh strategies with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings and story scenarios are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're free to ignore the story and play however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each run, your score is displayed and ranked online against other players.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882600?t=1752902338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882600?t=1752902338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882600/4bbe517102c3fbadc1f493842c8bfde44a60184f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752902338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882600/4bbe517102c3fbadc1f493842c8bfde44a60184f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752902338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a high school girl stranded on a deserted island. Craft tools, find food, and strive to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can play up to Day 20 in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr